  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Pacific Organisations of Persons with Disabilities (2017 - 2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Disability-inclusive development in the Pacific investment provides support for movement strengthening, capacity building and technical assistance to Organisations of Persons with Disabilities (OPDs) in the Pacific. This investment contributes to Australia&apos;s regional efforts to increase disability advocacy and services support, to increase the quality of life of people with disabilities. 

Included in this investment is direct support for the Pacific Disability Forum, the regional umbrella for OPDs in the Pacific, to progress disability-inclusive development outcomes. 

This investment will add to the knowledgebase for effective practices in supporting inclusive development and governance across the Pacific region.</narrative>
  </description>
